WEBVTT

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:04.120
Ritu Karidhal Srivastava:
I am from Lucknow,

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.640
from a middle class family

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.150
where education was of prime importance.

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:12.890
Usually, when I would stay up late 
to study at night,

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:14.850
my mother stayed awake, too,

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:17.780
so I didn’t get scared.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:20.760
I was always drawn to stars.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:24.540
I thought about what existed 
beyond this dark space.

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:27.390
Science was not just a subject for me,

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:31.620
but a passion that was drawing 
me to my goal.